# Optional contact form endpoint. Any URL that accepts a JSON POST and returns 2xx on success
# (e.g. https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxx, a serverless function, or a MuleSoft/CRM lead API).
# When empty, the form opens the visitor's email app addressed to reachus@iyanlabs.com
# and never claims the message was sent.
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
